{"scraped_at": "2026-06-04T07:26:16.694941+00:00", "run_id": "20260604_072616", "page": 49, "api_response": {"count": 3946, "per_page": 20, "current_page": 49, "total_pages": 198, "next": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=50&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "previous": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=48&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "results": [{"review_id": 586889734, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r586889734-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Holy temple for all Hindus!", "text": "Interesting place as you enter the complex,you walk past the river and the funeral ghats before you go to the main temple where hundreds of Shiva Devotees waiting in line to make their offerings and prayers and performing rituals with families.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2018-05-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "CB6A0E4150F7F68FBAFB5A4F302931A9", "name": "nims", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/nims", "username": "nims", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/29/9e/13/da/caption.jpg", "contribution_count": 615, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-06-12", "published_at_date": "2018-06-12"}, {"review_id": 586828160, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r586828160-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "A great experience", "text": "I came here to see the temple and to view the ceremonial cremation ghats.\nAs a non Hindu, I was not allowed into the temple which was a bit disappointing but the ghats were worth the visit alone.  \nWell worth the trip and the entrance fee ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2018-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "65E9A4868BD5B4D1F7747D46692BCDA6", "name": "sarah_townsend_8888", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/sarah_townsend_8888", "username": "sarah_townsend_8888", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e2/11/default-avatar-2020-41.jpg", "contribution_count": 4, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 255115, "location_name": "Wellington", "location_name_detailed": "Wellington, New Zealand"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-06-12", "published_at_date": "2018-06-12"}, {"review_id": 586711399, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r586711399-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Only Hindust could enter the main temple", "text": "This is the historic and one of the most important hinduist temple. I didn't know at first that it has crematorial sites nearby. Not feeling well at first, but it's a good experience overall. Beware of what the guide asks you to pay.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2018-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "167559E8EB2D62AE323D481B4ECB7F8C", "name": "Tor R", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Torezto", "username": "Torezto", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e8/5b/default-avatar-2020-61.jpg", "contribution_count": 10, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 293916, "location_name": "Bangkok", "location_name_detailed": "Bangkok, Thailand"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-06-11", "published_at_date": "2018-06-11"}, {"review_id": 586698793, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r586698793-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Must visit for all the pilgrims", "text": "A trip to Nepal is incomplete without visiting Pashupati Nath Temple. The areas is very well manged there is a parking space, dedicated space to keep shoes, wash hands and legs. \nThe only thing the visitors must be careful off the the pandit's sitting in the other small temples inside the big one. They con you by giving you a rudraksh ki mala, generally they will give you 5 mukhi mala which outside will cost you around 50 nepali rupees and in return they will ask you to give them dakshina and not less than 200 nepali rupees.\nOut of curiosity i spoke to a local shopkeeper sitting just outside the temple who told me that these pandit's have made it their business, they con people for money and they are not even ashamed of doing this sitting inside such a holy place. \nI got conned, so people just a warning please be careful.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2018-05-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "26328AA946603C21DB3E8661A3044132", "name": "Meghna Puri", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/vivoavaijar", "username": "vivoavaijar", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/e5/89/94/caption.jpg", "contribution_count": 174, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304551, "location_name": "New Delhi", "location_name_detailed": "New Delhi, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-06-11", "published_at_date": "2018-06-11"}, {"review_id": 586568420, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r586568420-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Om Namah Shivaya", "text": "I want always more and more blessings from our Lord Shiva. Everything I visit Nepal, I visit Pashupatinath. When I reach there, I feel so calm and  feel out of stress.  ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2018-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "9E9FA50677D243F7FC298EE98119F2C9", "name": "Shiv K", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/shivk865", "username": "shivk865", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/04/29/00/e0/shiv-k.jpg", "contribution_count": 15, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297628, "location_name": "Bengaluru", "location_name_detailed": "Bengaluru, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-06-11", "published_at_date": "2018-06-11"}, {"review_id": 586389573, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r586389573-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Peace ", "text": "Wow simply wow ..... such a beauty we have ....... Pashupatinath temple is not just a small temple but a huge which includes so many small temples...... this temple allows only Hindu people ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2018-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"review