ath temple is a must visit temple in Kathmandu. It has a very important significance in Hindu religion and it is a part of \"char dham yatra\" in which Kedarnath darshan (India) and pashupatinath temple Kathmandu are considered as head and body of lord shiva.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2018-05-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "73066C1E50A3F44B78B4E33009942B1E", "name": "amol khedkar", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/amolkhedkar", "username": "amolkhedkar", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e4/2d/default-avatar-2020-48.jpg", "contribution_count": 62, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297649, "location_name": "Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar", "location_name_detailed": "Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2018-06-07", "published_at_date": "2018-06-07"}, {"review_id": 585657929, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r585657929-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "First visit but memorable ", "text": "This haritage religious place i heard about since long but hadn't visit yet this time Kathmandu trip with my husband we planned to visit this temple pasupatinath and I found such nanu things i saw here feel totally different ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2017-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "4BA98551CF30292E6758A519D62F1038", "name": "Ankitpaudel", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Ankitpaudel", "username": "Ankitpaudel", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/phot